OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for 24 years after
OL,4,Aex-partner murder attempt that sparked
OL,5,Amanhunt
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man who repeatedly stabbed his
OL,8,Fex-partner in the chest then ran away,
OL,9,Flaunching a four-day manhunt, has been
OL,10,Fjailed for 24 years.
OL,12,FJoanne Sidaway, 49, screamed as she was
OL,13,Fattacked by James McKenna, 58, in the
OL,14,Fbushes of Carmarthen Park in January.
OL,16,FAfter hiding in a wood near Carmarthen
OL,17,Ffor three days without food or water,
OL,18,FMcKenna was arrested in a hospital as
OL,19,Fhe awaited medical treatment for
OL,20,Fsuspected frostbite.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
